LumioBomber block texture pack (Client/Assets/Blocks)

Everything in this directory is released under the Creative Commons CC0 1.0
Universal Public Domain Dedication (SPDX: CC0-1.0). It comes from two sources;
SOURCES.md records the source of every texture file.

1. Kenney Voxel Pack, by Kenney Vleugels for Kenney (www.kenney.nl),
   https://kenney.nl/assets/voxel-pack . Kenney released it under CC0 1.0; the
   license text shipped in the pack is kept verbatim in LICENSE-kenney.txt.
   The textures copied from it are listed in SOURCES.md with the original file
   name and sha256. water.png and ice.png are derived from Kenney originals
   (kept in source/kenney/) by changing the alpha channel only.

2. Self-drawn by the LumioBomber contributors: the remaining textures, the
   preview image under preview/, every lumio.*.json block asset description,
   pack.json, and the generator source/generate-textures.mjs. The self-drawn
   textures are produced procedurally by that script; no external image,
   texture pack, or Minecraft / Mojang asset was used, traced, or referenced.
   To the extent possible under law, the LumioBomber contributors have waived
   all copyright and related or neighboring rights to these files by dedicating
   them to the public domain under CC0 1.0.

Full legal code: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

The rest of the LumioBomber repository is licensed separately (see the LICENSE
file at the repository root).

If a texture from another source is added later, its source, version, author
and license are recorded per file in SOURCES.md, and CC-BY-4.0 textures are
credited in ATTRIBUTION.md. Only CC0-1.0 and CC-BY-4.0 are accepted.
